---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How PDF Fluid handles data and analytics.">
  <section class="page-head"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated September 2026.</p></div></section>
  <div class="container prose" style="max-width:760px;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:56px">
    <p>PDF Fluid is a static website. We do not require accounts and we do not collect or store any files.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand which pages are useful, which search terms people use on the site, and how visitors find us. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects anonymised usage data such as pages visited, approximate location, device type and referring site. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>
    <h2>Feedback buttons</h2>
    <p>When you click “Was this page helpful?”, your answer is recorded anonymously as an analytics event.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>Our guides link to third-party tools and websites. Their privacy practices are their own; please review them before uploading documents.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent via the contact details on our About page.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
